        "subject": "LU-21061 lod: give new stripes of a split dir its default LMV",
        "message": "LU-21061 lod: give new stripes of a split dir its default LMV\n\nThe MDT of a stripe of a striped directory takes the default LMV from\nthe stripe for the subdirectories and files it makes there, but the\nstripes that a split adds get none, while the master and the old\nstripes keep it.  A plain directory that is split keeps its default\nLMV only on its inode, which becomes stripe 0, since MDD does not move\nit to the new master (LU-13560).  New subdirectories and files lose\nthe default layout, and with it the pool of the tree: their files get\nobjects outside the OSTs of the pool.  The stripes that a split adds\nare also allocated on any MDT, not only on those of the pool.\n\nIn lod_dir_declare_create_stripes() and lod_xattr_set_lmv(), set the\ndefault LMV of a directory being split on its new stripes, as\nlod_split_dmv() reads it from the master.  For a plain directory, take\nit from stripe 0 if it names a pool, for any MDT and with a stripe\ncount of at least 1, and set it on the master and stripe 0 too.  In\nlod_dir_declare_layout_split(), allocate the new stripes from the MDTs\nof the pool of the default LMV, or else of the request, as for a new\ndirectory, as many as the pool has left.  An automatic split of a\ndirectory with a stripe on every MDT of its pool gets -EALREADY, as\nfor a directory split already.  mdt_auto_split() then sets\nmot_auto_split_disabled on the directory, so that\nmdt_getattr_internal() stops queueing it and its locks are not taken\nagain at every getattr while it stays cached, until a later split or\nmerge moves its entries again (mdt_restripe_migrate_add()).\n\nAdd ost-pools tests 35i-35l: splits by hand and auto-splits of plain\nand striped directories, in one pool and in small pools nested in a\nbig one.\n\nTest-Parameters: mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=ost-pools\nSigned-off-by: Di Wang <diwa@nvidia.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 ltvm\nChange-Id: I5aa16dd75bb4e8575f3086b867a65addc0985a34\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
